{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/b534640b02141762ac5e2e533ed0e273.webp?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/9852c91c2fb954a3434ef042b58f1ba1.poster.avif?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/9852c91c2fb954a3434ef042b58f1ba1.webm?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/9852c91c2fb954a3434ef042b58f1ba1.mp4?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a selection of procedural bonsai trees and make them your own by growing, cutting, and twisting branches to create your perfect little bonsai. Grow your collection and unlock new trees as you progress, or create your own procedural trees and plants with the plant editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/0ba595f3f848cc6f4915b3d8396588f3.webp?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/c7d8e6b8ebc8bef5eeb37360268c464b.poster.avif?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/c7d8e6b8ebc8bef5eeb37360268c464b.webm?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/c7d8e6b8ebc8bef5eeb37360268c464b.mp4?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell a story and build beautiful scenes using a wide range of props \u2013 everything from stones and lanterns to retro tech, tree houses, and cozy clutter. Change season, cover props in moss, customize the terrain, and more. Unlock and collect new props and pots to express your creativity in countless ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/4c4d21e11510c2204033faa5b4a68394.webp?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/8b28d953fec162d14649cae12b10cb65.poster.avif?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/8b28d953fec162d14649cae12b10cb65.webm?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/8b28d953fec162d14649cae12b10cb65.mp4?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into TinyTreeTalk\u1390net, a nostalgic, fictional bonsai forum that lives inside the game. Customize your profile and volunteer to help virtual members  with their diorama requests. Restore old bonsai trees, build new dioramas, and put your own twist on the requests.  Receive heartwarming comments, gifts, and other unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/9c6ffeae1435119a58d5348a9ead9b6a.webp?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/a713b4d79131c3c7985e961cd3365188.poster.avif?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/a713b4d79131c3c7985e961cd3365188.webm?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/a713b4d79131c3c7985e961cd3365188.mp4?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in immaculate vibes and unwind to chill lofi beats and '90s retro aesthetics. Customize your music, soundscape, room, and surrounding environment. Decorate your tree with cozy lanterns as you see the rain drip down and the trams run by outside your window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/7210a090eb195be968c2263c43c3208f.webp?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/254cb16c43604a482c3f72e27131bf30.poster.avif?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/254cb16c43604a482c3f72e27131bf30.webm?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/254cb16c43604a482c3f72e27131bf30.mp4?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the diorama in first-person, or simply lean back and relax with a distraction free environment and a beautiful diorama in the background. Use the Pomodoro timer, to-do list, or other productivity tools to focus and get work done.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/def4e01572f3c1698c67edd83cf22acf.webp?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/187df522f1f08462af8e9c0373b74a7a.poster.avif?t=1762803367\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/187df522f1f08462af8e9c0373b74a7a.webm?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/extras/187df522f1f08462af8e9c0373b74a7a.mp4?t=1762803367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take beautiful photos. Set up the picture perfect scene by changing the time of day and weather. Customize the camera settings or choose from a selection of presets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403560?t=1762803367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/8ce805d46926966d36bbc9a744bc5aa0d64a4932/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762803367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403560/2b0b63a82b7a12f42229e384883510b2b4ef2014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762803367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/